addCollateral.tree
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with MarketPaused
├── when market is frozen
│   └── it should revert with MarketFrozen
└── when market is not paused and not frozen
    ├── when assets is zero
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    ├── when onBehalf is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    └── when inputs are valid
        ├── it should transfer collateral tokens from sender to market
        ├── it should increase position collateralShares
        └── it should emit AddCollateral event 